      "is_staff": false,
      "last_edit_date": 0,
      "message_parsed": "Пользователь AnSan обновил ресурс <a href=\"https://torrentpier.com/forum/resources/shablon-taurus.249/\" class=\"link link--internal\">Шаблон Taurus</a> новой записью:<br />\n<br />\n<a href=\"https://torrentpier.com/forum/resources/shablon-taurus.249/update?update=394\" class=\"link link--internal\">Шаблон Taurus</a><br />\n<br />\n<blockquote class=\"xfBb-quote\" data-name=\"\"><a href=\"https://torrentpier.com/attachments/4422/\">View attachment 4422</a> <a href=\"https://torrentpier.com/attachments/4421/\">View attachment 4421</a></blockquote><br />\n<a href=\"https://torrentpier.com/forum/resources/shablon-taurus.249/update?update=394\" class=\"link link--internal\">Узнать больше об этом обновлении...</a>",
      "message_state": "visible",
      "position": 1,
      "post_date": 1467028861,
      "user_id": 35,
      "user_title": "User",
      "username": "AnSan"
    },
    {
      "attach_count": 0,
      "attachments": [],
      "id": 87903,
      "is_admin": false,
      "is_moderator": false,
      "is_staff": false,
      "last_edit_date": 0,
      "message_parsed": "косяк с отображение %<br />\nв privmsg.php <br />\n&#039;INBOX_LIMIT_IMG_WIDTH&#039; =&gt; max(4, $box_limit_img_length),<br />\nзаменить на<br />\n&#039;INBOX_LIMIT_IMG_WIDTH&#039; =&gt; $box_limit_img_length,",
      "message_state": "visible",
      "position": 2,
      "post_date": 1467063221,
      "user_id": 6554,
      "user_title": "User",
      "username": "Fakt_37"
    },
    {
      "attach_count": 0,
      "attachments": [],
      "id": 87904,
      "is_admin": false,
      "is_moderator": false,
      "is_staff": false,
      "last_edit_date": 0,
      "message_parsed": "а вообще я что то не обнаружил нигде $bb_cfg[&#039;privmsg_graphic_length&#039;].<br />\nтогда нахрена нужна вообще INBOX_LIMIT_IMG_WIDTH<br />\nв privmsg.php<br />\n$box_limit_img_length = $box_limit_percent = $l_box_size_status = &#039;&#039;;<br />\nменяем на<br />\n$box_limit_percent = $l_box_size_status = &#039;&#039;;<br />\nудаляем<br />\n$box_limit_img_length = min(round(($pm_all_total / $max_pm) * $bb_cfg[&#039;privmsg_graphic_length&#039;]), $bb_cfg[&#039;privmsg_graphic_length&#039;]);<br />\nи<br />\n&#039;INBOX_LIMIT_IMG_WIDTH&#039; =&gt; $box_limit_img_length,<br />\nв privmsg.tpl<br />\n&lt;input type=&quot;text&quot; data-fgColor=&quot;#3F97FE&quot; data-min=&quot;0&quot; data-max=&quot;100&quot; data-width=&quot;100&quot; data-height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;progress&quot; value=&quot;{INBOX_LIMIT_IMG_WIDTH}&quot; data-readOnly=&quot;true&quot;/&gt;<br />\nменяем на<br />\n&lt;input type=&quot;text&quot; data-fgColor=&quot;#3F97FE&quot; data-min=&quot;0&quot; data-max=&quot;100&quot; data-width=&quot;100&quot; data-height=&quot;100&quot; class=&quot;progress&quot; value=&quot;{INBOX_LIMIT_PERCENT}&quot; data-readOnly=&quot;true&quot;/&gt;",
